  "PATCH /api/projects/{id}": {
    "summary": "Move the stage machine: `signoff`, `revoke_signoff`, `advance`, `confirm_completion`, cancellation and skip actions.",
    "notes": "Three exits: mutual sign-off (8 of 12 stages), `advance` (sent_for_review needs `stage_key`; revisions), `confirm_completion` (final_payment only). `ALLOWED_TRANSITIONS` in packages/core is the source of truth. Payment gates open only on a Razorpay-confirmed capture."
  },
